    <briefdescription>
<para>One worker&apos;s thread, queue, lock and condition variable. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each worker has its own mutex so submitters and workers do not contend on a single lock. depth and idle are atomics so <ref refid="classBoundedExecutor_1a23e0bc9b4043755faf6f7b419cfec09b" kindref="member">submit()</ref> can make scheduling decisions without locking every worker. (&quot;Contend&quot; means having to wait for the same lock; giving each worker its own reduces that waiting.) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
